@user_id = 1

### List Users
# @name List Users
# Optional query parameters: page[offset], page[limit], filter[state], filter[active], filter[groupid], filter[search], filter[registrationDateStart], filter[registrationDateEnd], filter[lastVisitDateStart], filter[lastVisitDateEnd]
